SUMMARY:HerImpact 2026: Who Decides — You or AI?
LOCATION:Im Viadukt\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:Talks and a panel on who stays accountable when AI shapes an or
 ganisational decision — who can question it\, correct it or stop it — 
 drawing on current Swiss and Japanese research and real cases\, closing wi
 th questions the group puts forward for the 2027 Geneva summit.\n\nOrganis
 er: SOTRAI (Source of Trust in AI)\n\nDetails and registration: https://sw
 issdataevents.ch/events/herimpact-who-decides-zurich-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/herimpact-who-decides-zurich-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
